                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "E. Arbitration Provisions",
            "block_bbox": [
                61,
                324,
                243,
                343
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    61.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    242.0,
                    324.0
                ],
                [
                    242.0,
                    342.0
                ],
                [
                    61.0,
                    342.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. If the Association elects to submit the grievance to arbitration, it shall, with ten (10) days of its notice to the Superintendent, request the Federal Mediation and Conciliation Service to submit a panel of seven (7) arbitrators who are specially qualified to hear public sector grievances, from which the parties shall select an arbitrator by the alternate striking method or other mutually agreeable method.",
            "block_bbox": [
                86,
                343,
                517,
                469
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    86.0,
                    343.0
                ],
                [
                    517.0,
                    343.0
                ],
                [
                    517.0,
                    469.0
                ],
                [
                    86.0,
                    469.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. If for some reason the arbitrator is unable to serve or the parties mutually agree that no person on the panel is suitable, the parties shall jointly request the Federal Mediation and Conciliation Service to submit a new panel of seven (7) arbitrators from which an arbitrator will be selected in the same manner. This shall not preclude the parties from jointly selecting an arbitrator not listed on the panel.",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                471,
                518,
                596
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    85.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    518.0,
                    471.0
                ],
                [
                    518.0,
                    596.0
                ],
                [
                    85.0,
                    596.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. All arbitration proceedings shall be conducted under and governed by the appropriate rules of the Federal Mediation and Conciliation Service.",
            "block_bbox": [
                86,
                598,
                517,
                652
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    86.0,
                    598.0
                ],
                [
                    517.0,
                    598.0
                ],
                [
                    517.0,
                    652.0
                ],
                [
                    86.0,
                    652.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The parties agree to accept the arbitrator's award as binding upon them.",
            "block_bbox": [
                86,
                656,
                518,
                691
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    86.0,
                    656.0
                ],
                [
                    518.0,
                    656.0
                ],
