                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. The parties anticipate that the arbitrator will issue his decision in a timely manner from the day of the close of the hearing or from the date that post-hearing briefs are submitted.",
            "block_bbox": [
